WEBVTT

00:05.000 --> 00:09.580
<b><i>I'm very good at seeing people</i>
<i>for who they are.</i></b>

00:10.670 --> 00:13.420
<b>That's why you can't bring yourself
to betray your mom</b>

00:13.500 --> 00:16.130
<b>and things between you and Ozu are awkward.</b>

00:16.380 --> 00:21.460
<b><i>Senpai is the one who changed me</i>
<i>and showed me a new world.</i></b>

00:21.880 --> 00:26.750
<b><i>So it's only when I'm around him that</i>
<i>I'm able to stop analyzing people.</i></b>

00:27.210 --> 00:29.630
<b><i>That's why I tend to take advantage of him.</i></b>

00:29.960 --> 00:32.540
<b><i>I feel bad, but...</i></b>

00:33.540 --> 00:35.540
<b>Want to do some shopping with me tomorrow?</b>

00:35.630 --> 00:36.750
<b>Huh?!</b>

00:38.080 --> 00:40.130
<b>I'll ask the others, too.</b>

00:40.210 --> 00:42.580
<b>Instead of just being my friend's sister,</b>

00:42.670 --> 00:45.330
<b>why don't we try being friends for a change?</b>

00:46.210 --> 00:51.170
<b><i>I thought he was asking me out on a date</i>
<i>and got all excited! Unbelievable!</i></b>

00:51.790 --> 00:55.290
<b><i>I mean, that's just who Senpai is, though.</i></b>

00:55.380 --> 00:59.830
<b><i>Also, how could I get so worked up over</i>
<i>an invite like that?! Am I really that weak?!</i></b>

01:00.500 --> 01:03.290
<b><i>I bet my brother will</i>
<i>catch a clue and bow out,</i></b>

01:03.380 --> 01:09.210
<b><i>and Sumire-chan-sensei will refuse</i>
<i>to hang out with students on a day off.</i></b>

01:09.710 --> 01:12.830
<b><i>But... not her.</i></b>

01:13.170 --> 01:16.040
<b><i>I'm positive she'll come along.</i></b>

01:16.920 --> 01:18.750
<b><i>My woman's intuition is telling me</i></b>

01:18.830 --> 01:22.420
<b><i>that Mashiro-senpai likes Senpai for sure!</i></b>

01:22.960 --> 01:25.420
<b><i>My ongoing showdown with Senpai</i>
<i>will have to be put on hold.</i></b>

01:26.210 --> 01:29.330
<b><i>Today, it's me versus Mashiro-senpai!</i></b>

01:29.420 --> 01:30.460
<b><i>It's on!</i></b>

01:31.080 --> 01:32.790
<b>I won't lose!</b>

01:58.710 --> 02:04.380
<b>MY FRIEND'S LITTLE SISTER HAS IT IN FOR ME!</b>

03:04.790 --> 03:08.460
<b>#06 "MY FRIEND'S LITTLE SISTER
HAS IT IN FOR MY FRIEND'S ENEMY"</b>

03:10.460 --> 03:12.500
<b><i>Just three of us at this IRL meetup?</i></b>

03:12.920 --> 03:14.000
<b>Hey!</b>

03:14.210 --> 03:16.330
<b>Senpai, you're late!</b>

03:16.750 --> 03:19.250
<b>How could you make a girl wait? Unbelievable!</b>

03:19.580 --> 03:20.790
<b>Scum.</b>

03:20.880 --> 03:25.500
<b>Why do you two harmonize so well
only when it comes to dissing me?</b>

03:25.920 --> 03:28.290
<b>Okay, well, now that we're all here...</b>

03:28.830 --> 03:31.130
<b>Wh-What the heck are you doing?!</b>

03:31.210 --> 03:33.960
<b>Why, I'm linking arms with you, of course!</b>

03:34.080 --> 03:36.290
<b>All friends do that, don't they?</b>

03:36.380 --> 03:38.420
<b>Don't approach me like you would another girl!</b>

03:38.500 --> 03:40.500
<b>Nothing about this makes sense!</b>

03:40.580 --> 03:42.500
<b>I can't help it.</b>

03:42.580 --> 03:46.750
<b>The only kinds of friendly physical contact
I know are the ones used between girls!</b>

03:47.130 --> 03:48.920
<b><i>Th-This little...</i></b>

03:50.580 --> 03:51.540
<b>H-Hey!</b>

03:51.630 --> 03:55.790
<b>I-If it's a normal thing between friends,
I have to do it, too.</b>

03:55.880 --> 03:57.290
<b>It's <i>not</i> normal!</b>

03:57.380 --> 03:58.830
<b>I-I don't believe you!</b>

03:59.210 --> 04:02.080
<b>If you'll do it with Iroha-chan,
I'm doing it, too.</b>

04:02.670 --> 04:04.710
<b><i>I have no words.</i></b>

04:06.750 --> 04:09.210
<b>Look at us! We're a legit harem!</b>

04:09.290 --> 04:12.710
<b>Senpai, you're totally the protagonist
of a harem story right now!</b>

04:15.170 --> 04:16.920
<b>Y-You...</b>

04:19.420 --> 04:22.330
<b>Man, my stomach hurts. I'm gonna die.</b>

04:22.420 --> 04:25.630
<b>You're laughing way too much!
You should be as embarrassed as me!</b>

04:25.710 --> 04:27.710
<b>- Get off!
- Nope!</b>

04:27.790 --> 04:32.040
<b>My own shame doesn't matter
as long as I'm making you uncomfortable!</b>

04:32.130 --> 04:34.000
<b><i>She is </i>such<i> a pain in the ass.</i></b>

04:34.750 --> 04:38.170
<b>Okay, fine. Let's go see a movie first.</b>

04:38.250 --> 04:39.750
<b>Come on, off we go!</b>

04:39.960 --> 04:41.000
<b>This one!</b>

04:41.170 --> 04:42.210
<b>This one!</b>

04:44.210 --> 04:46.040
<b>This one's a huge hit!</b>

04:46.130 --> 04:49.040
<b>It's the obvious choice for
a couple to see together!</b>

04:49.130 --> 04:50.500
<b>We're not a couple.</b>

04:50.580 --> 04:53.290
<b>Movies that cater to the masses are boring.</b>

04:53.380 --> 04:54.790
<b>Sharks are befitting of early summer.</b>

04:55.250 --> 04:59.670
<b>Why should I have to waste a precious day off
watching a crappy movie like that?</b>

04:59.750 --> 05:01.580
<b>You don't get it, Iroha-chan.</b>

05:01.670 --> 05:05.750
<b>Low-budget B movies inspire tears.
Just think of the financial constraints!</b>

05:05.830 --> 05:08.330
<b>- I want to cry at the film, not the production!
<i>- I don't even care either way.</i></b>

05:08.420 --> 05:12.170
<b>So you're content with artificial tears
from carefully calculated stimuli?</b>

05:12.250 --> 05:15.880
<b>That's so systematic.
No different from cutting onions.</b>

05:15.960 --> 05:21.750
<b>Thinking you're cool for defying the masses
is the opposite of cool, Mashiro-senpai.</b>

05:22.670 --> 05:25.710
<b>Then could you speak at length
on the appeal of this film?</b>

05:25.790 --> 05:27.040
<b>On what level do you appreciate it?</b>

05:27.130 --> 05:31.580
<b>How can you be sure you're not just
regurgitating other people's opinions?</b>

05:31.670 --> 05:33.790
<b>Oh, now you've picked a fight!</b>

05:33.880 --> 05:36.250
<b>You've challenged me to a duel!</b>

05:36.330 --> 05:39.080
<b>Don't blame me if you suffer
a humiliating defeat and cry later.</b>

05:39.170 --> 05:42.420
<b>I'll have you know I've seen more
movies than you could even imagine.</b>

05:42.920 --> 05:46.040
<b>By letting yourself into my place and
watching them on streaming services.</b>

05:46.130 --> 05:50.040
<b>Well, your house is my house, basically!</b>

05:50.960 --> 05:53.170
<b>Watching movies... at Aki's place?</b>

05:53.250 --> 05:56.630
<b>More than I could imagine?
You're there <i>that</i> frequently?!</b>

05:56.920 --> 06:00.500
<b>That's right! Practically every day, in fact!</b>

06:00.830 --> 06:02.380
<b>Okay, Iroha, cut it out.</b>

06:02.830 --> 06:06.420
<b>If you're gonna fight this much,
we'll all see what we want to see</b>

06:06.500 --> 06:08.330
<b>and meet back here when we're done.</b>

06:08.420 --> 06:09.500
<b>Perfect solution, right?</b>

06:09.580 --> 06:10.670
<b>Vetoed!</b>

06:10.750 --> 06:12.630
<b>- Yeah. Vetoed.
- Why?!</b>

06:12.710 --> 06:16.130
<b>What even made you think
that suggestion would fly?</b>

06:16.210 --> 06:21.960
<b>A group of friends going to a theater to
watch separate movies is double unbelievable!</b>

06:22.040 --> 06:25.130
<b>Garbage men who don't understand
women's hearts should die.</b>

06:25.210 --> 06:27.960
<b><i>They could at least show a </i>little<i> mercy.</i></b>

06:28.420 --> 06:31.460
<b>Let's take the democratic approach, then.</b>

06:31.880 --> 06:33.460
<b>Rock, paper...</b>

06:35.460 --> 06:37.290
<b>MY FOE'S NAME</b>

06:45.460 --> 06:47.670
<b>That was pretty fun in the end, huh?</b>

06:47.750 --> 06:48.790
<b>Right?!</b>

06:48.880 --> 06:49.960
<b>Don't be a pain.</b>

06:50.040 --> 06:51.960
<b>Oh, I'll be right back.</b>

06:52.040 --> 06:53.920
<b>- Bathroom?
- Okay, you just lost points.</b>

06:54.000 --> 06:57.460
<b>What, even <i>that</i> counts as inappropriate?
That's kinda harsh!</b>

06:57.540 --> 07:00.290
<b>You just take things too loosely.</b>

07:00.380 --> 07:03.080
<b>Oh, want to tag along, Mashiro-senpai?</b>

07:03.710 --> 07:06.210
<b>No, I'm fine.</b>

07:06.670 --> 07:08.580
<b>Oh... Okay.</b>

07:09.080 --> 07:10.960
<b>Well, back in a minute, then!</b>

07:13.500 --> 07:14.880
<b>Nerves getting to you?</b>

07:15.210 --> 07:16.380
<b>Well... Yeah.</b>

07:16.830 --> 07:19.250
<b>I still don't really know
how to deal with Iroha-chan.</b>

07:19.330 --> 07:21.500
<b>Yeah, she's a real pain, isn't she?</b>

07:21.580 --> 07:24.960
<b>Sh-She's not! I know she's not a bad person.</b>

07:25.080 --> 07:28.670
<b>I actually feel bad for not
knowing how to deal with her.</b>

07:28.750 --> 07:32.130
<b>I'd say not knowing how
to deal with Iroha is normal.</b>

07:32.210 --> 07:34.080
<b>- For me, at least...
- It's not!</b>

07:34.170 --> 07:36.460
<b>It's not... that.</b>

07:37.210 --> 07:40.670
<b>Her hyper personality reminds me...
of people in my past...</b>

07:40.750 --> 07:43.040
<b>who I couldn't stand.</b>

07:45.710 --> 07:48.960
<b>I won't pry, but if you wanna
talk about it, I'll listen.</b>

07:50.290 --> 07:52.960
<b>Hey, look! It's Tsukinomori-san!</b>

07:53.960 --> 07:55.960
<b>Ooh, she's with a guy!</b>

07:56.040 --> 07:59.460
<b>A lovey-dovey date with a guy?
That's friggin' hilarious!</b>

08:00.290 --> 08:02.040
<b>Right? That's wild!</b>

08:02.130 --> 08:03.130
<b>Um...</b>

08:03.210 --> 08:07.290
<b>What? I can't hear you
when you mumble like that.</b>

08:07.380 --> 08:10.790
<b>So this is Tsukinomori-san's
boyfriend? Huh?</b>

08:12.170 --> 08:14.460
<b>Wow, he's a perfect match for her!</b>

08:14.540 --> 08:18.080
<b>He looks like spends all his time
in class reading manga in the corner!</b>

08:18.170 --> 08:20.250
<b>For real! I see it!</b>

08:20.330 --> 08:23.420
<b>What gives you the right to show up
out of nowhere and run your mouths?</b>

08:23.500 --> 08:25.670
<b>How about you try reading the room a little?</b>

08:25.750 --> 08:27.790
<b>Ooh, check out Mr. Cool!</b>

08:27.880 --> 08:30.460
<b>Hey, does your wonderful boyfriend know?</b>

08:30.540 --> 08:31.830
<b>You know, about <i>that</i>.</b>

08:31.920 --> 08:33.630
<b>Oh, I gotta know!</b>

08:33.710 --> 08:37.540
<b>Have you had him read that <i>adorable</i> novel?</b>

08:39.420 --> 08:42.290
<b>Stop... Don't talk about that.</b>

08:42.670 --> 08:44.500
<b>What? Can't hear you!</b>

08:44.580 --> 08:46.880
<b>You were keeping it secret from him, huh?</b>

08:46.960 --> 08:49.210
<b>Sorry for spilling the beans.</b>

08:49.960 --> 08:52.880
<b>- Oh, snap! I think she's gonna cry!
- That's too crazy!</b>

08:53.500 --> 08:55.040
<b>That's enough.</b>

08:57.750 --> 09:00.750
<b>Whoa, what're you getting all serious for?</b>

09:00.830 --> 09:04.580
<b>Your voices, your faces, your personalities...
Everything about you disgusts me.</b>

09:04.960 --> 09:06.460
<b>Get out of here right now.</b>

09:06.830 --> 09:09.630
<b>W-Watch yourself, you useless loner!</b>

09:09.710 --> 09:13.210
<b>We've got a really strong guy
backing us, you know!</b>

09:13.630 --> 09:15.040
<b>So what?</b>

09:15.130 --> 09:18.960
<b>The people we've got
backing us are a lot crazier.</b>

09:19.080 --> 09:20.710
<b><i>I mean, it's not a lie.</i></b>

09:20.790 --> 09:25.330
<b><i>One of them is a teacher who</i>
<i>writes oneshota porn doujins.</i></b>

09:25.710 --> 09:26.710
<b>Huh?</b>

09:26.790 --> 09:30.880
<b>Uh, we might be in trouble.
He looks way too confident.</b>

09:30.960 --> 09:32.420
<b>Come on, let's just go.</b>

09:32.880 --> 09:34.380
<b><i>Thanks, Shikibu!</i></b>

09:38.880 --> 09:40.750
<b>You okay, Mashiro?</b>

09:43.880 --> 09:46.500
<b>That's why you started
skipping school, isn't it?</b>

09:47.330 --> 09:48.420
<b>Yeah.</b>

09:48.500 --> 09:50.380
<b>What was the novel they mentioned?</b>

09:51.670 --> 09:53.330
<b>I-I'm...</b>

09:53.830 --> 09:55.040
<b>I'm sorry!</b>

09:55.710 --> 09:56.750
<b>Hey!</b>

09:57.420 --> 09:58.380
<b><i>Oh, crap.</i></b>

09:58.460 --> 10:00.750
<b>Senpai! What are you doing?</b>

10:00.830 --> 10:02.750
<b>We have to go after her!</b>

10:04.500 --> 10:07.210
<b>I'll look upstairs. You take downstairs.</b>

10:07.290 --> 10:08.830
<b>Roger that!</b>

10:11.250 --> 10:14.250
<b>MY FRIEND'S LITTLE SISTER HAS IT IN FOR ME!</b>

10:18.210 --> 10:20.250
<b><i>I don't see her anywhere.</i></b>

10:22.830 --> 10:25.790
<b><i>It's too inefficient to</i>
<i>run around searching blindly.</i></b>

10:26.210 --> 10:27.880
<b><i>What place is she most likely to go?</i></b>

10:34.750 --> 10:35.710
<b>Having fun?</b>

10:35.790 --> 10:37.080
<b>Never been happier.</b>

10:37.170 --> 10:38.880
<b>You don't look it, though.</b>

10:38.960 --> 10:43.670
<b>The girl who just died was a popular girl
on the cheerleading squad.</b>

10:43.750 --> 10:45.750
<b>She bullied the otaku boy.</b>

10:46.250 --> 10:47.630
<b>Serves her right.</b>

10:48.040 --> 10:49.420
<b>What are <i>you</i> here for?</b>

10:49.500 --> 10:50.960
<b>To see the movie.</b>

10:51.080 --> 10:53.130
<b>Liar. Stalker.</b>

10:54.500 --> 10:57.290
<b>I'm sorry I keep insulting you.</b>

10:57.830 --> 11:02.000
<b>Better that than being unable
to insult the people who deserve it.</b>

11:02.380 --> 11:04.330
<b>Throw all the insults you want.</b>

11:04.420 --> 11:05.830
<b>Aki...</b>

11:06.460 --> 11:08.670
<b>"You're free to hate me,"</b>

11:08.750 --> 11:10.790
<b>"but if you hate me, just leave me alone."</b>

11:10.880 --> 11:14.790
<b>"Quit riding my ass over every
little thing, you stalker bitches."</b>

11:15.330 --> 11:17.790
<b>Things would be easier
if you could say that to them, huh?</b>

11:17.880 --> 11:18.920
<b>Yeah.</b>

11:21.290 --> 11:24.750
<b>I've always been awkward
around people I didn't know.</b>

11:24.830 --> 11:26.960
<b>I never fit in anywhere.</b>

11:27.040 --> 11:28.420
<b>I was always alone.</b>

11:29.040 --> 11:33.790
<b>S-So I started writing
a novel to escape reality...</b>

11:34.170 --> 11:37.080
<b>and those two girls found it.</b>

11:37.380 --> 11:39.290
<b>Then they told everyone about it.</b>

11:40.290 --> 11:44.880
<b>It's just cruel. It hurts
being exposed like that.</b>

11:44.960 --> 11:48.250
<b>Even I have my pride.</b>

11:52.880 --> 11:56.290
<b>I like novels written
as an escape from reality.</b>

11:56.380 --> 11:57.500
<b>Huh?</b>

11:57.960 --> 12:00.880
<b>I know someone else who's just like that.</b>

12:00.960 --> 12:04.670
<b>A professional novelist,
and I'm a huge fan.</b>

12:05.080 --> 12:07.710
<b>You've heard of Makigai Namako-sensei, right?</b>

12:08.920 --> 12:12.790
<b>Uh... Y-Yes, I guess.</b>

12:12.880 --> 12:15.790
<b>Anyone who's interested in novels
knows that name, right?</b>

12:15.880 --> 12:18.460
<b>The top newcomer at UZA Bunko!</b>

12:18.920 --> 12:22.830
<b><i>And a reliable ally who, for some reason,</i>
<i>decided to assist 05th Floor Alliance.</i></b>

12:23.290 --> 12:24.830
<b>The afterword on one book said,</b>

12:25.330 --> 12:28.830
<b>"Written out of a desire
to shatter this garbage reality."</b>

12:29.380 --> 12:31.630
<b>That really moved me.</b>

12:31.710 --> 12:32.670
<b>Do you know why?</b>

12:32.750 --> 12:34.830
<b>N-No. Why?</b>

12:35.250 --> 12:37.880
<b>Because I deeply sympathized
with everything in the book.</b>

12:37.960 --> 12:40.080
<b>Its whole value system,</b>

12:40.170 --> 12:42.830
<b>the pointless strangers
who interfere with one's own life,</b>

12:43.210 --> 12:46.460
<b>the nauseating shitbags
who always look like winners</b>

12:46.540 --> 12:50.630
<b>but have to trample on the losers
in order to feel good about themselves.</b>

12:51.040 --> 12:53.500
<b>The dissatisfaction with society,</b>

12:53.580 --> 12:55.080
<b>the feelings of irritation...</b>

12:55.170 --> 12:57.330
<b>I sympathized with all of that.</b>

12:58.290 --> 13:01.210
<b>And what's more, that book
went on to become a huge hit.</b>

13:01.290 --> 13:03.040
<b>It resonated with a lot of people.</b>

13:03.130 --> 13:06.880
<b>So it's really nothing to be
embarrassed about, is it?</b>

13:07.920 --> 13:10.710
<b>But that author just goes
by a pen name, right?</b>

13:10.790 --> 13:13.790
<b>I still think it's shady.</b>

13:13.880 --> 13:16.580
<b>If people found out who the person was...</b>

13:17.290 --> 13:21.460
<b>They might be embarrassed
if people learned their identity.</b>

13:21.540 --> 13:24.960
<b>Well, you can't stop someone
from feeling embarrassed.</b>

13:25.080 --> 13:28.170
<b>But I'd never deny you your hobby.</b>

13:28.250 --> 13:32.290
<b>Just realize that there are lots of folks
out there who'd affirm your work, too.</b>

13:32.380 --> 13:33.420
<b>Yeah.</b>

13:34.210 --> 13:37.630
<b>But... Iroha-chan still looks
just like them to me.</b>

13:38.080 --> 13:39.920
<b>As in those girls who messed with you earlier?</b>

13:40.000 --> 13:41.920
<b>Yeah. Sorry.</b>

13:42.000 --> 13:44.960
<b>But my instincts tell me
we just won't get along.</b>

13:45.080 --> 13:49.210
<b>Even if we become friends,
she'll only end up bullying me one day.</b>

13:49.290 --> 13:50.830
<b>Don't worry.</b>

13:51.540 --> 13:55.290
<b>She's annoying, but she differs
from them on a fundamental level.</b>

13:56.040 --> 13:59.210
<b>If Iroha ever does anything to hurt you,</b>

13:59.290 --> 14:01.580
<b>I'll lecture her until she cries.</b>

14:01.670 --> 14:02.880
<b>Aki...</b>

14:03.170 --> 14:05.500
<b>It'll be fine. Don't worry.</b>

14:05.580 --> 14:08.210
<b>So just relax and follow me!</b>

14:10.670 --> 14:11.710
<b>Okay.</b>

14:12.750 --> 14:14.210
<b><i>Found Mashiro.</i></b>

14:14.290 --> 14:15.880
<b><i>Where are you right now?</i></b>

14:15.960 --> 14:18.290
<b><i>Upstairs in the rest area!</i></b>

14:18.670 --> 14:20.670
<b>That totally never happened!</b>

14:20.750 --> 14:23.960
<b>I know, right? That girl, I swear...</b>

14:24.080 --> 14:25.040
<b>It's hilarious!</b>

14:25.130 --> 14:27.710
<b>- Huh...
- She hasn't changed at all!</b>

14:29.000 --> 14:31.790
<b>See? She's one of them! They're laughing it up!</b>

14:32.080 --> 14:34.290
<b>I'm not so sure. Watch.</b>

14:35.130 --> 14:39.130
<b>You guys have been dissing
the hell out of Mashiro-senpai.</b>

14:39.210 --> 14:40.960
<b>I guess that means...</b>

14:41.040 --> 14:45.880
<b>you're total loser trash that isn't even
worthy of kissing the ground she walks on!</b>

14:45.960 --> 14:47.210
<b>Huh?</b>

14:48.130 --> 14:54.500
<b>I mean, a cutie like her, on a date with
her perfect boyfriend on their day off,</b>

14:54.580 --> 14:57.380
<b>compared to two stupid bitches
with ugly personalities</b>

14:57.460 --> 15:01.500
<b>throwing their precious lives in the trash...</b>

15:01.580 --> 15:02.960
<b>It's night and day!</b>

15:03.080 --> 15:06.750
<b>Oh, God! What cruel inequality!</b>

15:06.830 --> 15:09.420
<b>It's just too tragic!</b>

15:09.500 --> 15:11.880
<b>H-Hey, you looking for a fight?!</b>

15:12.830 --> 15:17.080
<b>Don't run your mouth if you're not
prepared for the consequences, small fry.</b>

15:19.080 --> 15:22.540
<b>I-Iroha-chan? Wh-What just happened?</b>

15:22.630 --> 15:24.630
<b>It's a little skill of hers.</b>

15:24.960 --> 15:27.960
<b>That was just a bluff,
but it looks like it worked plenty well.</b>

15:29.130 --> 15:32.250
<b>This is the secret weapon
05th Floor Alliance is so proud of:</b>

15:32.330 --> 15:34.750
<b>the power of a voice actress
with unlimited range.</b>

15:36.880 --> 15:40.790
<b>I heard what you did to
Mashiro-senpai, assholes.</b>

15:41.330 --> 15:44.790
<b>Pond scum like you shouldn't be walking
around pretending to be human.</b>

15:45.380 --> 15:48.750
<b>Y-You said earlier that you
weren't her friend.</b>

15:48.830 --> 15:52.580
<b>I'm not Mashiro-senpai's friend. Yet.</b>

15:53.040 --> 15:56.080
<b>But that's got nothing to do with it!</b>

15:59.330 --> 16:03.580
<b>See, I've just taken a real dislike
to you two and your rotten personalities.</b>

16:04.040 --> 16:09.290
<b>So I'm gonna rearrange your faces
until they look even worse...</b>

16:09.380 --> 16:12.380
<b>than your shitty makeup! Now, come on!</b>

16:12.460 --> 16:14.040
<b>Clench those teeth!</b>

16:15.080 --> 16:16.710
<b>That's enough.</b>

16:18.210 --> 16:21.500
<b><i>Damn, she's scary! Even knowing</i>
<i>it's a bluff, that's intense!</i></b>

16:22.670 --> 16:26.790
<b>Like I told you earlier, we've got
some real crazy ones backing us.</b>

16:27.420 --> 16:31.500
<b>I won't bother to make you
apologize or anything.</b>

16:31.920 --> 16:34.330
<b>But don't ever show your
faces around Mashiro again.</b>

16:34.420 --> 16:37.170
<b>Just ignore her. That's all you need to do.</b>

16:37.250 --> 16:38.290
<b>You got all that?</b>

16:39.540 --> 16:41.290
<b>Good. Negotiations complete.</b>

16:41.380 --> 16:44.750
<b>- Bye, now!
- We're sorry!</b>

16:45.710 --> 16:47.000
<b>Senpai...</b>

16:47.540 --> 16:49.500
<b>Nice timing!</b>

16:49.580 --> 16:51.790
<b>You saved my skin! Seriously!</b>

16:52.170 --> 16:54.790
<b>Don't launch suicide attacks
on your own like that.</b>

16:54.880 --> 16:58.040
<b>Yeah, I have zero actual
fighting experience, after all.</b>

16:58.130 --> 17:02.000
<b>Whew! I'm so glad you showed up
before the mask came off!</b>

17:02.290 --> 17:04.960
<b>Damn, you're one handful
of a junior, you know that?</b>

17:05.500 --> 17:08.710
<b>Still, you were actually pretty
pissed at them, weren't you?</b>

17:08.790 --> 17:10.460
<b>Of course I was!</b>

17:11.040 --> 17:12.750
<b>The old me wouldn't have been able</b>

17:12.830 --> 17:17.500
<b>to do anything but see them
for what they were, though.</b>

17:18.080 --> 17:20.130
<b>Just don't overdo it, okay?</b>

17:20.210 --> 17:22.420
<b>Well, you were there for me today!</b>

17:22.500 --> 17:24.670
<b>Not that I mind, I guess.</b>

17:24.750 --> 17:26.330
<b>Well? What do you think, Mashiro?</b>

17:26.750 --> 17:28.790
<b>- This is who Iroha is.
- Huh?</b>

17:28.880 --> 17:30.580
<b>Mashiro-senpai?</b>

17:31.040 --> 17:33.420
<b>Oh, man, you saw all that?</b>

17:33.500 --> 17:36.710
<b>Sorry if I said some stuff
I had no business saying.</b>

17:36.790 --> 17:40.040
<b>No, I'm the one who should apologize to you.</b>

17:40.130 --> 17:41.830
<b>Huh? What for?</b>

17:42.380 --> 17:44.670
<b>I totally misunderstood you.</b>

17:44.750 --> 17:47.710
<b>I thought you were the same as those girls.</b>

17:47.790 --> 17:48.960
<b>But...</b>

17:49.290 --> 17:50.710
<b>She was wrong.</b>

17:52.830 --> 17:56.330
<b>Please be my friend!</b>

18:00.000 --> 18:01.580
<b>I'd love to!</b>

18:02.420 --> 18:05.960
<b>Yay! Mashiro-senpai's my friend now!</b>

18:08.880 --> 18:11.960
<b>Boy, you sure exceeded
my expectations, Akiteru-kun!</b>

18:12.460 --> 18:15.920
<b>She's been enjoying going to school,
and she's even made a friend.</b>

18:16.000 --> 18:20.540
<b>She says she might even be able to forget
her terrible memories from her last school.</b>

18:21.380 --> 18:23.290
<b>I was right to entrust her to you.</b>

18:23.380 --> 18:25.040
<b>I'm glad to hear it.</b>

18:25.130 --> 18:28.210
<b>By the way, I hear the girl she befriended</b>

18:28.290 --> 18:31.460
<b>is Kohinata Iroha-kun from 05th Floor Alliance.</b>

18:31.540 --> 18:34.830
<b>Well, technically,
she's not a member of the group.</b>

18:35.500 --> 18:40.170
<b>She provided the voices for <i>The Night</i>
<i>the Black Goat Screamed</i>, didn't she?</b>

18:41.460 --> 18:43.790
<b>What makes you think that?</b>

18:44.210 --> 18:47.750
<b>Mashiro told me she had
a remarkable talent for acting.</b>

18:47.830 --> 18:50.670
<b>And, of all the people in your circle,</b>

18:50.750 --> 18:54.040
<b>who but the mysterious voice actress
could be such an acting prodigy?</b>

18:54.130 --> 18:57.130
<b>The voice acting credits
aren't public information,</b>

18:57.540 --> 19:00.130
<b>so, well... it's not necessarily
just one person.</b>

19:00.210 --> 19:01.830
<b>What are you talking about?</b>

19:02.500 --> 19:06.460
<b>I've known from the start that
you had just the one voice actress.</b>

19:06.670 --> 19:07.710
<b>Huh?!</b>

19:08.250 --> 19:11.420
<b>Despite appearances, I worked my way
up from the trenches, you know.</b>

19:11.500 --> 19:17.210
<b>I can tell whether multiple voices
are coming from one person or many.</b>

19:18.210 --> 19:21.330
<b>Um, regarding Iroha being our voice actress...</b>

19:21.710 --> 19:24.710
<b>Oh, I know. You want me
to keep it secret, right?</b>

19:24.790 --> 19:28.040
<b>Secrets add to the allure
of both men and women.</b>

19:28.130 --> 19:29.420
<b>They're a good thing to have.</b>

19:29.500 --> 19:30.790
<b>I appreciate it.</b>

19:31.420 --> 19:33.750
<b>Now, getting back on topic...</b>

19:33.830 --> 19:36.210
<b>I wanted to discuss this Kohinata Iroha-kun.</b>

19:36.920 --> 19:40.330
<b>She isn't your actual girlfriend, is she?</b>

19:40.790 --> 19:43.960
<b>Absolutely not.
I'd stake my own organs on it.</b>

19:45.330 --> 19:47.500
<b>Okay, good to know!</b>

19:47.580 --> 19:52.830
<b>Do continue to enjoy a healthy student life
with Mashiro and your friends!</b>

19:52.920 --> 19:54.380
<b>I will. No need to tell me twice.</b>

19:54.460 --> 19:56.330
<b>And as I said before...</b>

19:56.670 --> 19:59.580
<b>if you become her boyfriend
for real, you will regret it.</b>

19:59.920 --> 20:02.130
<b>As I've told you, that won't be a problem.</b>

20:02.830 --> 20:07.080
<b>You worry too much.
I don't think Mashiro even likes me.</b>

20:09.540 --> 20:11.630
<b><i>He's a good guy.</i></b>

20:11.710 --> 20:15.380
<b><i>It's just a shame he's</i>
<i>such a blockhead, isn't it,</i></b>

20:16.130 --> 20:17.710
<b><i>Mashiro?</i></b>

20:18.460 --> 20:23.540
<b><i>I'm so glad I talked Dad</i>
<i>into letting me switch schools.</i></b>

20:23.960 --> 20:30.420
<b><i>I met precious allies who kept me going</i>
<i>while I stayed holed up at home.</i></b>

20:30.500 --> 20:35.830
<b><i>But... I still can't bring myself</i>
<i>to tell them who I am.</i></b>

20:36.210 --> 20:41.670
<b><i>Aki... doesn't realize that</i>
<i>I'm Makigai Namako, right?</i></b>

20:42.210 --> 20:45.750
<b><i>I was so happy when he said</i>
<i>he was a huge fan, but...</i></b>

20:46.790 --> 20:48.960
<b>I want to get closer.</b>

20:50.710 --> 20:52.630
<b><i>I want to be special to him,</i>
<i>more than I am now.</i></b>

20:53.250 --> 20:55.500
<b><i>And not as Makigai Namako.</i></b>

20:55.960 --> 20:58.830
<b><i>That's why I chased him this far.</i></b>

21:02.460 --> 21:04.130
<b><i>So... go!</i></b>

21:04.210 --> 21:05.670
<b><i>"You are scum!"</i></b>

21:05.750 --> 21:07.630
<b><i>Riot in the red-light district</i></b>

21:08.080 --> 21:10.170
<b><i>You're kickin' us all in the asshole</i></b>

21:10.250 --> 21:13.380
<b>- Here.
<i>- But you're my friend's little sister</i></b>

21:13.460 --> 21:16.500
<b>Ow! That was super mean, Senpai!</b>

21:16.580 --> 21:19.460
<b>How are you gonna take responsibility
if you blow out my eardrums?!</b>

21:19.960 --> 21:22.330
<b>If that happens, I'll marry you
or whatever else you want.</b>

21:22.420 --> 21:23.500
<b>Huh?!</b>

21:23.830 --> 21:25.580
<b>Which is just a joke.</b>

21:26.080 --> 21:28.170
<b>That stereo automatically adjusts</b>

21:28.250 --> 21:32.830
<b>so it won't damage your eardrums even if
you set the volume to max. It's fine.</b>

21:32.920 --> 21:35.880
<b>Oh, I see! Right!</b>

21:35.960 --> 21:39.080
<b>It did feel icky at first,
but I'm actually fine.</b>

21:39.170 --> 21:41.170
<b>I've always believed that
if you're gonna splash out,</b>

21:41.250 --> 21:43.880
<b>you might as well spend
the money on quality.</b>

21:43.960 --> 21:47.460
<b>For real? I've been using them
without a second thought.</b>

21:47.880 --> 21:49.420
<b>You've really used these a lot, huh?</b>

21:49.790 --> 21:51.750
<b>Well, sure.</b>

21:51.830 --> 21:55.040
<b>They're the one thing I need most
for the studying I want to do.</b>

21:55.790 --> 21:58.750
<b>After using these,
learning lots of acting styles,</b>

21:58.830 --> 22:01.330
<b>and hearing lots of different actors' voices,</b>

22:01.420 --> 22:04.080
<b>I can really tell how far I've come.</b>

22:04.580 --> 22:07.040
<b>All thanks to this gift you gave me, Senpai!</b>

22:07.380 --> 22:10.290
<b>If you're grateful, stop messing
with me all the time.</b>

22:10.380 --> 22:13.750
<b>It's <i>because</i> I'm grateful
that I mess with you, though!</b>

22:13.830 --> 22:16.330
<b>Don't you understand how
this maiden's heart works?</b>

22:16.420 --> 22:17.500
<b>Nope.</b>

22:18.130 --> 22:20.960
<b>I genuinely like you enough</b>

22:21.080 --> 22:24.040
<b>to be jealous of Mashiro-senpai, though.</b>

22:24.130 --> 22:26.540
<b>You're not fooling me.
I know you're just teasing again.</b>

22:28.290 --> 22:29.880
<b>I'm serious!</b>

22:29.960 --> 22:32.380
<b>I was already all hyped up,
like, "I'm not gonna lose!"</b>

22:32.460 --> 22:36.420
<b>and "I'm the one who's gonna
be by Senpai's side!"</b>

22:36.500 --> 22:39.630
<b>But after all that, you got along fine
with Mashiro, didn't you?</b>

22:39.710 --> 22:43.250
<b>By the end, you weren't even
rivals anymore, just friends.</b>

22:43.710 --> 22:46.630
<b>I was all ready for a competition,</b>

22:46.710 --> 22:51.540
<b>but then I just wanted to put
those stupid bullies in their place.</b>

22:52.250 --> 22:55.580
<b>Aw, man! They ruined everything!</b>

22:55.670 --> 22:56.920
<b>Seriously!</b>

22:58.540 --> 23:04.250
<b>Which is why, to make up for my defeat,
I'll be staying at your place even more!</b>

23:04.330 --> 23:05.460
<b>That makes no sense.</b>

23:07.540 --> 23:10.420
<b>Who is it? I wanna see!</b>

23:11.920 --> 23:15.500
<b>Wait... This is...</b>

23:17.250 --> 23:21.170
<b>I LOVE YOU. I LOVE YOU MORE
THAN ANYONE IN THE WORLD.</b>

23:21.250 --> 23:26.210
<b>BETTER WATCH NEXT TIME...
OR YOU KNOW WHAT'LL HAPPEN, RIGHT?</b>
